    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "i mean i have people i can talk to but it just feels like a burden to them too. like if i tell them how much i'm struggling i'm just adding more weight to their shoulders. it's easier to just be quiet. sometimes it feels like the world would just keep spinning just fine if i wasn't part of it. does that ever make sense to anyone else? or am i just being dramatic?",
